{"seq":2,"slug":"organizational-frontiers","title":"组织与战略前沿","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/management/organizational-frontiers","introMarkdown":"# 组织与战略前沿 简介\n\n组织与战略领域正在经历深刻的范式变革。数字技术的渗透重塑了企业的边界与能力基础，平台经济的崛起颠覆了传统的价值创造逻辑，而可持续发展压力则迫使管理者重新审视企业的根本目的与利益相关者关系。对于管理学博士研究者而言，理解这些前沿领域不仅是把握学术发表趋势的需要，更是发展有影响力研究议题的关键前提。\n\n本知识库围绕三个核心章节展开：\n\n**第一章 数字化转型**系统梳理组织数字化转型的理论基础与研究前沿。从数字战略框架到组织变革的微观机制，从数字成熟度模型到数字化悖论，帮助研究者理解技术驱动的组织变革背后的深层逻辑，以及如何将信息系统理论与组织理论有效整合来解释新现象。\n\n**第二章 平台生态系统**深入剖析平台经济的核心运行机制。平台已经从一种商业模式演变为一种新的组织形态和治理模式。本章涵盖多边市场理论、平台治理架构设计以及生态系统的共演化动态，为研究者提供分析平台竞争、互补者策略和生态系统健康的理论工具。\n\n**第三章 可持续管理**聚焦于组织如何应对日益紧迫的环境与社会挑战。从 ESG 评估框架到利益相关者资本主义的理论辩论，从循环经济的商业模式创新到碳中和战略的实施路径，帮助研究者在可持续性这一快速增长的学术领域找到有价值的研究切入点。\n\n建议学习路径：先理解数字化转型的技术-组织互动机制，再扩展到平台生态系统的跨组织动态，最后聚焦可持续管理中的制度压力与战略响应，三者共同构成理解当代组织变革的完整理论视角。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-transformation","title":"数字化转型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/management/organizational-frontiers/digital-transformation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-strategy-business-model","title":"博士 组织与战略前沿 — 数字战略与商业模式创新","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/management/organizational-frontiers/digital-transformation/digital-strategy-business-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"organizational-change-implementation","title":"博士 组织与战略前沿 — 组织变革与数字化实施","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/management/organizational-frontiers/digital-transformation/organizational-change-implementation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-maturity-performance","title":"博士 组织与战略前沿 — 数字成熟度与绩效评估","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/management/organizational-frontiers/digital-transformation/digital-maturity-performance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-ecosystems","title":"平台生态系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/management/organizational-frontiers/platform-ecosystems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multisided-markets-economics","title":"博士 组织与战略前沿 — 多边市场与平台经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/management/organizational-frontiers/platform-ecosystems/multisided-markets-economics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-governance-architecture","title":"博士 组织与战略前沿 — 平台治理与架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/management/organizational-frontiers/platform-ecosystems/platform-governance-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ecosystem-dynamics-coevolution","title":"博士 组织与战略前沿 — 生态系统动态与共演化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/management/organizational-frontiers/platform-ecosystems/ecosystem-dynamics-coevolution"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"sustainable-management","title":"可持续管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/management/organizational-frontiers/sustainable-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"esg-framework-assessment","title":"博士 组织与战略前沿 — ESG 框架与评估方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/management/organizational-frontiers/sustainable-management/esg-framework-assessment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stakeholder-capitalism-institutions","title":"博士 组织与战略前沿 — 利益相关者资本主义与制度理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/management/organizational-frontiers/sustainable-management/stakeholder-capitalism-institutions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"circular-economy-carbon-neutrality","title":"博士 组织与战略前沿 — 循环经济与碳中和战略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/management/organizational-frontiers/sustainable-management/circular-economy-carbon-neutrality"}]}]}